humbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad22cd15/uploads/origins/146cce8d-d3e2-45e9-b3d9-bfcb20d456eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd48a7cbebe63dfe0bd50090c4ae61e8, https://si.imgix.net/ad22cd15/uploads/origins/146cce8d-d3e2-45e9-b3d9-bfcb20d456eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22e5a909f9fb5d6dda1df5183d125c38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad22cd15/uploads/origins/146cce8d-d3e2-45e9-b3d9-bfcb20d456eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c23a5f73ff6949571c240832d229945 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ポケモン2匹でも可でしたら\n\nウルトラネクロズマのZワザ「天焦がす滅亡の光」を受けて、膨大な光に覆われる最中だけども\n退屈そうに欠伸してるポチエナ&毛づくろいしてるチョロネコのイラストをお願いします。\n2匹共平然としていて「効果がないようだ…」と言わんばかりのダメージは一切無い感じでお願いします。\n\nウルトラネクロズマは直接描写しないで大丈夫です。\n\n\n「天焦がす滅亡の光」参照映像\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8jIttNj_No", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tk8d32/works/207", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a032546a/uploads/origins/9777a916-77da-4a85-aa29-bc919437d6d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5662c98530d22ecd336e14c039b043d3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a032546a/uploads/origins/9777a916-77da-4a85-aa29-bc919437d6d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5662c98530d22ecd336e14c039b043d3, https://si.imgix.net/a032546a/uploads/origins/9777a916-77da-4a85-aa29-bc919437d6d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bf2f848fff572a7b56341097fa5ebc5a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a032546a/uploads/origins/9777a916-77da-4a85-aa29-bc919437d6d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a8e02b575c40e23b2d2ec5980c025a7b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tk8d32/works/206", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ecfe4c78/uploads/origins/c00948d7-a53f-4139-8ac2-bf9ddbd3da39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffa17b8bb289e52d9c24100fddfe6a8a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ecfe4c78/uploads/origins/c00948d7-a53f-4139-8ac2-bf9ddbd3da39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffa17b8bb289e52d9c24100fddfe6a8a, https://si.imgix.net/ecfe4c78/uploads/origins/c00948d7-a53f-4139-8ac2-bf9ddbd3da39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=238335659363d05e1066856044434a56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ecfe4c78/uploads/origins/c00948d7-a53f-4139-8ac2-bf9ddbd3da39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10b1f235e20dd64a48d249b18d7a7379 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "連続での依頼失礼します。\n深海重巡水姫を依頼したものです。\n今回は重巡新棲姫の足裏見せプレイのイラストをお願いします。\n今回も艤装は無し\n通常モード\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tk8d32/works/205", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a48ee07f/uploads/origins/e64d71fd-48a1-4750-b577-174ed5148bec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a0f20be47ad5dbb1939f0491bd81a4f3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a48ee07f/uploads/origins/e64d71fd-48a1-4750-b577-174ed5148bec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a0f20be47ad5dbb1939f0491bd81a4f3, https://si.imgix.net/a48ee07f/uploads/origins/e64d71fd-48a1-4750-b577-174ed5148bec?bg=%23fff&aut